### ------------------------------------------------------------
### Spring AI Prompt Stuffing Demo - Olympics Controller
###
### This file demonstrates how to interact with the
### /olympics/2024 endpoint using different scenarios.
###
### The endpoint uses Spring AI's ChatClient to send prompts
### to an LLM (OpenAI GPT model) and optionally injects
### additional context using the "Prompt Stuffing" technique.
### ------------------------------------------------------------

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 1️⃣ Default Request
###
### Calls the endpoint without parameters.
###
### The controller will use the default question:
### "What sports are being included in the 2024 Summer Olympics?"
###
### Prompt Stuffing is DISABLED here, meaning:
### - No additional context document is injected
### - The LLM answers based only on its training knowledge
### ------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{baseUrl}}/olympics/2024

###

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 2️⃣ Custom Question (No Prompt Stuffing)
###
### Ask a custom question about Olympic sports.
###
### Prompt Stuffing is still disabled, so the model will
### rely only on its internal knowledge.
### ------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{baseUrl}}/olympics/2024?message=What new sports were added to the 2024 Olympics?

###

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 3️⃣ Enable Prompt Stuffing
###
### Setting "stuffit=true" enables the Prompt Stuffing technique.
###
### This means:
### - The file docs/olympic-sports.txt will be loaded
### - Its content will be injected into the prompt
### - The LLM will use that context to answer
###
### This demonstrates the "Bring Your Own Data" pattern.
### ------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{baseUrl}}/olympics/2024?stuffit=true

###

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4️⃣ Custom Question WITH Prompt Stuffing
###
### Here we combine:
### - a custom question
### - prompt stuffing enabled
###
### The context document will be injected into the prompt
### template before sending the request to the LLM.
### ------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{baseUrl}}/olympics/2024?message=List the sports in the 2024 Olympics&stuffit=true

###